# Workflow and repository-policy changes, the tooling config, and the dependency
# bot require DevOps review.
/.github/** @DevDogsUGA/devops
/devtools.config.json @DevDogsUGA/devops
/renovate.json5 @DevDogsUGA/devops

# The database: DevOps, and the leads, who also read every generated plan.
/supabase/** @DevDogsUGA/devops @kquakk @SidhantDash

# Only admins own the ownership policy itself. This must stay after the rules
# above because the last matching CODEOWNERS pattern wins.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @DevDogsUGA/admins
